You must specify the Key attributes of the item to be modiﬁed and an UpdateExpression to 
specify attribute values. UpdateItem behaves like an "upsert" operation. The item is updated if 
it exists in the table, but if not, a new item is added (inserted).
UpdateItem supports conditional writes, where the operation succeeds only if a speciﬁc
ConditionExpression evaluates to true. For example, the following UpdateItem operation 
does not perform the update unless the price of the song is greater than or equal to 2.00.
{ 
