    ConditionExpression: "Price >= :p",
    ExpressionAttributeValues: { 
        ":label": "Global Records",
        ":p": 2.00
    }
}
UpdateItem also supports atomic counters, or attributes of type Number that can be 
incremented or decremented. Atomic counters are similar in many ways to sequence generators, 
identity columns, or autoincrement ﬁelds in SQL databases.
